ploads/20240831/FvVtpvUXyhQkCdX438fo7DnT7LkF.jpg"},{"t":"img","v":"https://cdn.dengdengschool.com/uploads/20240831/FiqCeWM3sOrI2Le44ZJFqdU4SGXM.jpg"},{"t":"text","v":"光路如下（反光镜一转动后可以改变光路，实现超近场投影）："},{"t":"img","v":"https://cdn.dengdengschool.com/uploads/20240831/FmDftsNl0Hs8UU3ULZhrMufWAofK.jpg"},{"t":"text","v":"超近场投影反光镜一通过电机控制角度变换"},{"t":"img","v":"https://cdn.dengdengschool.com/uploads/20240831/FiJKnrTZaUZkrLBD1cPsMbBFjT20.jpg"},{"t":"text","v":"反光镜通过轴承与支架连接（金属卡片压在轴承上）"},{"t":"img","v":"https://cdn.dengdengschool.com/uploads/20240831/FpHLhk5jymbUCVq9zFg6NbHrbMTZ.jpg"},{"t":"img","v":"https://cdn.dengdengschool.com/uploads/20240831/Flmwcbd1QfnWfZQb6M4xAOsNZcSt.jpg"},{"t":"text","v":"继续拆"},{"t":"img","v":"https://cdn.dengdengschool.com/uploads/20240831/Fpp6lYpzKLlOQbDdcjYdUvnBOWKA.jpg"},{"t":"text","v":"反光镜"},{"t":"img","v":"https://cdn.dengdengschool.com/uploads/20240831/FhM9PeKX8UuPyhe2toNdyGaUMdeZ.jpg"},{"t":"text","v":"散热器：加了3根热管。"},{"t":"img","v":"https://cdn.dengdengschool.com/uploads/20240831/FvV7VeYha4Y2JCeMnQczLiQYDGzs.jpg"},{"t":"img","v":"https://cdn.dengdengschool.com/uploads/20240831/FtTn9Yvl7e8T9bNJTHOoJM4P2eYd.jpg"},{"t":"text","v":"好了，到此整个问界M9大灯我们就拆解结束了。最后，这款大灯来自星宇。"}],"coverImg":"https://cdn.dengdengschool.com/uploads/20240831/Fs76EMD9hkaSgSm70T5qek4JEExd.jpg"}